This package is an independent reimplementation, in TypeScript, of the
pattern matching and filename generation described in the zsh manual and
implemented in Src/pattern.c and Src/glob.c of the Z shell.  No zsh source
code is included or distributed here.  The test suite includes cases derived
from zsh's own Misc/globtests, which carries the zsh licence:

